  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.160" end="00:03.000" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me the truth</p>
      <p begin="00:03.000" end="00:06.070" ttm:agent="v1">This is the end</p>
      <p begin="00:06.070" end="00:11.780" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like losing myself</p>
      <p begin="00:11.780" end="00:14.310" ttm:agent="v1">Can't find my way</p>
      <p begin="00:14.310" end="00:17.470" ttm:agent="v1">To not lose you</p>
      <p begin="00:17.470" end="00:24.300" ttm:agent="v1">Why is it so complicated?</p>
      <p begin="00:24.300" end="00:28.850" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing makes me confused</p>
      <p begin="00:28.850" end="00:35.740" ttm:agent="v1">No wonder why</p>
      <p begin="00:35.740" end="00:40.250" ttm:agent="v1">I'm still in hell</p>
      <p begin="00:40.250" end="00:47.570" ttm:agent="v1">This is the moment, come</p>
      <p begin="00:47.570" end="00:55.570" ttm:agent="v1">Now, it's time to choose</p>
      <p begin="00:59.970" end="01:02.740" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, foo-foo</p>
      <p begin="01:02.740" end="01:05.770" ttm:agent="v1">Bring me to the dark</p>
      <p begin="01:05.770" end="01:08.270" ttm:agent="v1">Can't find you in the end</p>
      <p begin="01:08.270" end="01:11.090" ttm:agent="v1">Don't ever cry for me</p>
      <p begin="01:11.090" end="01:14.130" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, foo-foo</p>
      <p begin="01:14.130" end="01:22.130" ttm:agent="v1">So, tell you all the truth</p>
      <p begin="01:23.230" end="01:26.180" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me the truth</p>
      <p begin="01:26.180" end="01:28.860" ttm:agent="v1">This is the end</p>
      <p begin="01:28.860" end="01:34.320" ttm:agent="v1">I feel like losing myself</p>
      <p begin="01:34.320" end="01:37.270" ttm:agent="v1">Can't find my way</p>
      <p begin="01:37.270" end="01:40.120" ttm:agent="v1">To not lose you</p>
      <p begin="01:40.120" end="01:47.160" ttm:agent="v1">Why is it so complicated?</p>
      <p begin="01:47.160" end="01:51.200" ttm:agent="v1">Nothing makes me confused</p>
      <p begin="01:51.200" end="01:58.870" ttm:agent="v1">No wonder why</p>
      <p begin="01:58.870" end="02:03.030" ttm:agent="v1">I'm still in hell</p>
      <p begin="02:03.030" end="02:10.460" ttm:agent="v1">This is the moment, come</p>
      <p begin="02:10.460" end="02:18.460" ttm:agent="v1">Now, it's time to choose</p>
      <p begin="02:22.660" end="02:25.210" ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, foo-foo</p>
      <p begin="02:25.210" end="02:28.590" ttm:agent="v1">Bring me to the dark</p>
      <p begin="02:28.590" end="02:31.440" ttm:agent="v1">Can't find you in the end</p>
      <p begin="02:31.440" end="02:34.220" ttm:agent="v1">Don't ever cry for me</p>
